 "_about": "Maximize's own brand number per card number (giftcardId). Needed because Maximize's page only opens the card named in a link when the link is written the way its own listing writes it: /savemax/<slug>?flow=GIFTCARD&brandId=<brand>&giftcardId=<card>. A /gift-cards/<slug>/<card> link redirects with giftCardId (capital C), which the page ignores, and opens the brand's default card instead - a Tanishq Gold Jewellery link (1278) opened the Studded card (owner's test, 2026-11-04). One slug can span several Maximize brands (Yatra 470 is brand 16, Yatra Flight 1317 is brand 227), so the number is kept per card. Read off the hrefs of maximize.money/gift-cards in a logged-in Chrome on 2026-11-04.",
